Package: tsHtmlApp
Type: Package
Title: Generate Standalone HTML Time-Series Explorers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alek", "Rutkowski", email = "alek.rutkowski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Generates a single self-contained HTML application from a
    data.table containing time-series data. Embedded JavaScript provides
    categorical filtering, optional cascading choices, interactive Plotly
    charts, time-window selection, index rebasing, resizable chart cards,
    and data downloads. Generated applications work offline in a browser
    without an R session, Shiny, or a server.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    jsonlite,
    magrittr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: no
